  "highlights": [
    "Buxton 1: the lower Viola zone was perforated and acid-treated in late August. First swab runs brought up good oil with almost no water.",
    "RCR Newby 34-2: the Oklahoma Corporation Commission gave final approval of the Newby 34 injection well. About 330 feet of electrical line remains before startup.",
    "Newby 34-4: the gas test came back strong and Enerfin has agreed to take the gas. Tie-in is estimated at two to three weeks.",
    "Newby 34-5: the frac is back on the contractor's schedule now that the injection well is approved.",
    "Medicine Crow 33-1: results from the first acid treatment came in below expectations. An independent engineer is reviewing the data and a second treatment is planned."
  ]
